  "details": "If an imposter fails to generate, it is listed that the avatar still doesn't have any imposters, and that's correct, however now when the imposter would normally be seen for example on Quest or VRChat mobile if no android build is present, you will just appear as invisible to others instead of switching to your fallback avatar. Almost as if VRChat is looking for the imposter but nothing is there.\n\nI have tested this with multiple of my avatars where imposters failed to generate, And as far as I know there is no way to fix this except for getting one to actually generate successfully.\n\nSo if you have a complex avatar that you're fairly certain will fail to generate an imposter, don't try it!",
